<title>INDIA: HOCKEY-CHAMPIONS TROPHY HOCKEY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-CHAMPIONS TROPHY HOCKEY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRAS, India 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of play-offs for final standings in the Champions Trophy hockey tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>Spain beat Australia 5-2 (halftime 2-1)</p>
<p>Scorers: Spain - Ferran Santiago (11th min), Jorge Arnau (30), Juan Escarre (50), Javier Arnau (61) and (70).</p>
<p>Australia - Williams Todd (16) and Jeremy Hiskins (66).  </p>
<p>Germany beat India 5-0 (2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Sascha Reinelt (29th min); Christoph Bechman (30th, 51st, 62nd), Michael Waldhauser (70th).</p>
